Sintactically, yes. Semantically, no.

{pacipa} follows the same grammar as {paci'ipa}, but the
meanings are quite different. The first is 1E2+3E1+1E0.
The second I don't know what it is, but it is probably
not 1E2+ci'iE1+1E0.

